Package: patientSimCore
Type: Package
Title: Event-driven patient simulation scaffold (core)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jarrod", "Dalton", email = "jarrod.dalton@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: A scaffold for event-driven simulation projects in R. Provides a schema-based
    R6 Patient for mutable state with sparse history and an Engine for orchestrating
    simulations using pluggable ModelBundles loaded by ModelProviders (package, file,
    MLflow-friendly stubs). Supports non-uniform event times, event types, terminal events,
    and no-update events.
